      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casmalia%2C_California",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Southern Pacific Railroad arrived in 1896, sparking a boom that grew the town to over 1,500 residents in its early years.",
